    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;Specifies an associative table, defined by keys and values. MapProto is formed with a &quot; &quot;repeated field of keys (of type INT8, INT16, INT32, INT64, UINT8, UINT16, UINT32, &quot; &quot;UINT64, or STRING) and values (of type TENSOR, SPARSE_TENSOR, SEQUENCE, or MAP). Key &quot; &quot;types and value types have to remain the same throughout the instantiation of the &quot; &quot;MapProto.&quot; <linebreak/>
 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
